 ## Monitoring
 
-```bash
-# List recent builds
-npx --yes eas-cli@latest build:list
-
-# Check build status
-npx --yes eas-cli@latest build:view BUILD_ID
-
-# Inspect submissions (verified with EAS CLI 23.2.0)
